invariant: INV-16
file: ct.h
catches: unit_ct_widemul
reason: dropping the carry out of ct_widemul's first cross sum, which
  poly1305's limb products overflow on nearly every block, makes the
  recombined product wrong; every other unit binary asserts
  CH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL and compiles the line out, so the RFC 7748 and RFC
  8439 vectors see it only over the decomposition

--- old
    uint32_t hi = hh + (t >> 16) + (w1 >> 16);
--- new
    uint32_t hi = hh + (w1 >> 16);
